import csv

rows = [
    ["id", "nickname"],
    ["1", ""],
    ["2", r"\N"],
    ["3", "0"],
    ["4", "NULL"],
]
with open("presence.csv", "w", encoding="utf-8", newline="") as f:
    csv.writer(f).writerows(rows)

with open("presence.csv", encoding="utf-8", newline="") as f:
    for row in csv.DictReader(f):
        raw = row["nickname"]
        value = None if raw == r"\N" else raw
        print(row["id"], "raw=", repr(raw), "typed=", repr(value))
PY

xxd -g 1 presence.csv</code></div>
<p><strong>예상:</strong> Empty는 <code>''</code>, sentinel <code>\N</code>만 null, <code>'0'</code>과 <code>'NULL'</code>은 실제 strings다. Sentinel을 <code>NULL</code>로 바꾸면 row 4의 실제 값과 충돌한다.</p>

<h3 style="font-size:18px;color:#126246;">7.2 JSON: missing, null, empty, zero</h3>
<div style="background:#15211c;color:#e8f5ef;padding:15px;margin:12px 0;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;"><code>python3 - &lt;&lt;'PY'
MISSING = object()
rows = [
    {"id": 1},
    {"id": 2, "nickname": None},
    {"id": 3, "nickname": ""},
    {"id": 4, "nickname": 0},
]
for row in rows:
    v = row.get("nickname", MISSING)
    state = ("MISSING" if v is MISSING else
             "NULL" if v is None else
             "EMPTY" if v == "" else "VALUE")
    print(row["id"], state, repr(v) if v is not MISSING else "-")
PY</code></div>
<p><strong>예상:</strong> Key membership을 확인하면 네 상태가 보존된다. <code>row.get("nickname")</code>만 사용하면 missing과 explicit null이 모두 <code>None</code>이 되어 합쳐진다.</p>

<h3 style="font-size:18px;color:#126246;">7.3 SQL count와 three-valued logic</h3>
<div style="background:#15211c;color:#e8f5ef;padding:15px;margin:12px 0;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;"><code>python3 - &lt;&lt;'PY'
import sqlite3

db = sqlite3.connect(":memory:")
db.execute("create table t(id integer, nickname text)")
db.executemany("insert into t values (?, ?)", [
    (1, None), (2, ""), (3, "0"), (4, "Alice")
])
print("counts", db.execute(
    "select count(*), count(nickname), "
    "sum(nickname is null), sum(nickname = '') from t"
).fetchone())
print("equals-null", db.execute(
    "select count(*) from t where nickname = null"
).fetchone()[0])
print("is-null", db.execute(
    "select count(*) from t where nickname is null"
).fetchone()[0])
PY</code></div>
<p><strong>예상:</strong> <code>COUNT(*)=4</code>, <code>COUNT(nickname)=3</code>, null 1, empty 1이다. <code>= NULL</code>은 0 rows, <code>IS NULL</code>은 1 row를 찾는다.</p>

<h3 style="font-size:18px;color:#126246;">7.4 Patch semantics와 실패 주입</h3>
<div style="background:#15211c;color:#e8f5ef;padding:15px;margin:12px 0;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;"><code>python3 - &lt;&lt;'PY'
def apply_patch(current, patch):
    out = dict(current)
    if "nickname" in patch:
        out["nickname"] = patch["nickname"]
    return out

base = {"nickname": "Alice"}
for patch in ({}, {"nickname": None}, {"nickname": ""}):
    print("patch", patch, "=&gt;", apply_patch(base, patch))

def broken_patch(current, patch):
    out = dict(current)
    out["nickname"] = patch.get("nickname")
    return out
print("BROKEN missing =&gt;", broken_patch(base, {}))
PY</code></div>
<p><strong>예상:</strong> Empty patch는 KEEP, null은 CLEAR, empty string은 SET empty다. 실패 주입 함수는 missing key를 <code>None</code>으로 바꿔 의도치 않게 삭제한다.</p>
<p><strong>자주 나는 오류와 해결:</strong> Shell/Python에서 <code>\N</code> escape가 혼동되면 raw string을 사용하고 hex를 확인한다. SQLite는 SQL semantics 관찰용이며 production engine의 cast/null option은 공식 문서와 golden query로 다시 검증한다. Quoted/unquoted empty를 구분하려면 사용하는 CSV parser가 quote provenance를 제공하는지 확인한다.</p>
